		1950 -> 1953 [label=false,color=brown];
		1950 -> 1954 [label=false,color=brown];
		1950 -> 1955 [label=false,color=brown];
	1951 [label="If you think it's small to do what I do, sure. That's your opinion. What I've done has rewritten history.",shape=box,color=red];
		1951 -> 1957;
	1952 [label="Not small. Unseen. Let everyone run around drawing attention. I'll stay in the shadows.",shape=box,color=red];
		1952 -> 1958;
	1953 [label="Because helping people when they need it is how we are going to get out of this mess in the end.",shape=box,color=red];
		1953 -> 1959;
	1954 [label="Because I'm doing what needs to be done. Nothing more, nothing less.",shape=box,color=red];
		1954 -> 1960;
	1956 [label="You said you've never know what it's like to be loved. I don't think you'll understand how powerful it can be in changing how the world around you can work.",shape=box,color=red];
		1956 -> 1962;
	1955 [label="Have you ever been in love, Roathe? Or cared about someone so strongly you would burn the universe down for them?",shape=box,color=red];
		1955 -> 1961;
	1957 [label="That is precisely my point! Let us go and rewrite history, then! Not sit about here trying to convince everyone to hold hand and sing songs!",shape=box,color=blue];
		1957 -> 1963;
		1957 -> 1964;
		1957 -> 1965;
	1958 [label="Ah, I see, you prefer to be the quiet assassin in the shadows is it? Strike when you are least suspected? No. I do not think so. I think you are simply spinning your wheels.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1958 -> 1966;
	1959 [label="Mmhm. Running errands for strangers until they worship you like some local hero? Or convincing them all to hold hands and sing songs? Pardon me while I go retch into Fibonacci's tank.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1959 -> 1967;
		1959 -> 1968;
	1960 [label="And what you are \"doing\" seems to be running about convincing everyone to hold hands and sing songs in between bouts of incredible shows of violence. The violence makes sense. The rest is nauseating. ",shape=box,color=blue];
		1960 -> 1967;
		1960 -> 1968;
	1962 [label="If you are going to insist that we are going to save the universe from this \"Indifference\" by holding hands and singing songs pardon me while I go retch into Fibonacci's tank.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1962 -> 1970;
