	1963 [label="Be patient. We have to deal with the Indifference, first.",shape=box,color=red];
		1963 -> 1971;
	1964 [label="Maybe, once all of this has blown over. But not right now.",shape=box,color=red];
		1964 -> 1972;
	1965 [label="And you think I'd choose you to do it with? Don't make me laugh.",shape=box,color=red];
		1965 -> 1973;
	1966 [label="You know not what you do or why you do it, you are simply doing what you are told. Another self-important henchmen of a self-important Orokin. Shame.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1966 -> 1974;
	1967 [label="I'm just saying that you seem to be really mad about the idea of people no longer being miserable. And you seem to be taking that very personally.",shape=box,color=red];
		1967 -> 1975;
	1968 [label="The point I was trying to make was simply that if \"the Indifference\" feeds off a lack of emotions, having them might be the key to defeating it.",shape=box,color=red];
		1968 -> 1976;
	1970 [label="Do you think it's impossible for someone to love you? Or do you think you're not capable of feeling love for someone else? Or do you think it just hasn't happened yet?",shape=box,color=red];
		1970 -> 1977;
	1969 [label="No, I have not. And if you are going to insist that we are going to save the universe from this \"Indifference\" by holding hands and singing songs pardon me while I go retch into Fibonacci's tank.",shape=box,color=blue];
