	1974 [label="Chat ends.",color=orange];
	1975 [label="Because misery loves company? Perhaps. Or, because I am simply confused that you are running about wasting your time when there is real work that we could be doing.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1975 -> 1980;
	1976 [label="More proof that this thing is a figment of your imagination! What kind of real god or \"anti-god\" would ever be defeated by the \"kindness of human emotions!\" Ha! ",shape=box,color=blue];
		1976 -> 1981;
	1977 [label="Update boolean RoatheUnloved2",color=orange];
		1977 -> 1982;
	1978 [label="I suppose we still have work to do, as you say. I simply cannot fathom such... childish things have purpose to them. But, then again, here I sit on this end of things, and you are the one with keys to the universe.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1978 -> 1983;
	1979 [label="Fair point. Why would you ever pick someone so detestable as the Devil of Tau?",shape=box,color=blue];
		1979 -> 1984;
	1980 [label="But now I am convinced you know not what you do or why you do it, and that you are simply doing what you are told. Another self-important henchmen of a self-important Orokin. Shame.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1980 -> 1985;
